# Statusbar Colors   ----------------------------------------------------------------
color status color215 default
color status black color215 '([a-zA-Z\(\)0-9\%]+)'
color status black color215 '(\s+[a-zA-Z0-9\(])'

# Bubble — matches the ' [icon] count ' output of each %?x? [icon] %x ? conditional
# space + exactly one non-space icon char + space + digits + space
#color status color7 color8 ' [^\(] [0-9]+ '
#
#color status white color7 '[^]*'  # bubble content 1
# color status color7 color8 '(\s)+([a-zA-Z0-9\.,]|\[|\])'  # bubble content 2
# color status color7 color8 '(\% )'                       # % symbol
# color status color7 color8 '(\S)'                        # empty spaces
